    en: { tags: ['Syntha', 'purchasing', 'product'], title: 'Material purchasing is now part of Syntha’s core workflow', body: 'Material purchasing is now part of Syntha’s core workflow. Previously, the supplier request, quote, approval and order were handled manually, outside the system that already holds the specification and the collection volume.\n\nWhat changed: The price request, supplier quote, award and material purchase order run as one chain inside Syntha, on the same data as the spec. The chain is available in the Syntha interface and through the API.\n\nWhat it gives you:\n• The supplier is chosen on numbers already in the system, not a separate spreadsheet.\n• Material cost comes from the purchasing process itself, not from a reconciliation afterwards.\n• Fabric and trims are no longer handled outside the system.' }
